My impression is that lower level spells cost less energy
points and also cost less nutrition points.  So exercising
them before hunger free levels costs less.  If I am wrong on
this point then the spell in the school with the lowest
failure rate times nutrition costs per cast.  Once I have
hunger free casting then any spell in the school that can
be used in a safe environment.

Also some schools have a low level spell that's easily used
while safely away from combat.  The jump spell in the escape
school is easily exercised when moving from level to level
so it can be used enough to enhance that school easily.
The force bolt spell can be used by closing then blasting
doors on an explored level before descending, but there
aren't as many doors on most levels as there are spaces
to jump from stairs to stairs.



